Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.43,0:00:09.78,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.57,0:00:11.87,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:13.74,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.45,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time to go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.72,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't want to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:22.02,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:27.49,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,So, ready to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.83,0:00:29.54,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:39.56,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't think it's a good idea to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.46,0:00:43.64,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,A good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.74,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we stop somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:47.71,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.57,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's stop this. You're heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:51.99,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let me fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:55.70,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there a fish tank in your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.16,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,No, but we have a bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.45,0:01:00.16,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't use that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:04.25,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,When you get home, you have to put it in a water bucket!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:05.47,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.47,0:01:09.09,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to calmly ease it into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.31,0:01:19.45,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.72,0:01:25.49,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.72,0:01:29.42,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:37.15,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:40.50,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let me fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.07,0:01:44.16,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.59,0:01:52.50,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.46,0:01:54.47,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a river!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:55.46,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.23,0:02:01.39,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know that there was a place like this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.15,0:02:07.45,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Rin's first time here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.45,0:02:08.58,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:11.48,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,This is my first summer with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:16.81,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's dark. I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.81,0:02:18.94,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, teach us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.60,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,This way, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.53,0:02:27.35,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.59,0:02:29.64,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:20.13,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:22.01,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to play more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:24.47,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone looks tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:33.52,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,So Kouki, now we go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:35.15,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:36.48,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:38.17,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:43.53,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.02,0:03:57.27,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,You're standing on your tiptoes.
